WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:05.150
I hear Mother Dearest is taking up 
residence in an outlying village.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:07.160
Yeah, so it seems.

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.460
She took a ton of lumber from my workplace.

00:00:10.460 --> 00:00:11.380
What?!

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.280
It seems we have no choice now.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.010
What's the problem, Big Bro?

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:16.450
Is something going on?

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:18.610
We three siblings...

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.350
must move along with Mother Dearest!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:23.010
Do you hear yourself?

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.840
You're the high priest! 
Stop being ridiculous!

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.280
Besides, you know Mum 
would pound you for that!

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:31.010
She just went off on you not long ago!

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:05.980
<b>Relocating, Building, Flying, and the Earth</b>

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:05.980
<b>Relocating, Building, Flying, and the Earth</b>

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.930
Are you all right, Master?

00:02:11.930 --> 00:02:14.380
I'm... really not.

00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:17.550
Ow, my head...

00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:23.180
<i>As always, Cayna, you are 
experiencing hangover symptoms.</i>

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:24.300
<i>This makes a total of—</i>

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.810
Don't say it.

00:02:26.470 --> 00:02:30.710
This time, I absolutely swear 
I'll never drink again.

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:32.590
<i>You have also sworn that oath a total of—</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:34.490
I said don't. Seriously.

00:02:34.490 --> 00:02:35.750
Water...

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:37.460
Luka...

00:02:37.460 --> 00:02:39.800
Thank you so much!

00:02:44.630 --> 00:02:45.890
Mo—

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:46.870
Huh?

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.780
Are you okay?

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.680
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:02:51.050 --> 00:02:52.520
Thanks to you, Luka.

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.320
You smell like booze.

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:59.240
You needed to stop her before 
she could drink too much!

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:00.800
Luka, there's a very good reason for this!

00:02:59.240 --> 00:03:01.240
You useless stray cat!

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:01.420
<i>A reason?</i>

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:05.740
Too much? She collapsed after only one drink.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.220
Shut up, Kee.

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:08.660
You see, Luka, grown-ups have to do 
this thing we call "socializing."

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:08.440
Then stop her before she can have one drink!

00:03:08.440 --> 00:03:11.810
I bet you were just spacing out, weren't you?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.710
<i>Grown-ups?</i>

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:11.200
You shut up!

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:13.330
<i>Is going along with the 
crowd what grown-ups do?</i>

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.330
You numbskull!

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:16.500
I don't need comments like that 
from someone who wasn't there.

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:20.840
I was looking after Lady Luka!

00:03:20.840 --> 00:03:25.280
Come on, guys, don't fight. 
It's making my headache worse.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.770
I am so sorry.

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:27.770
Please forgive me.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:32.520
Now look, Roxine. Our master 
scolded us because of you.

00:03:32.520 --> 00:03:34.630
It was your fault, numbskull!

00:03:34.630 --> 00:03:35.730
Excuse me?!

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.480
Please stop.

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.240
Don't fight...

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:43.200
Are you okay, miss? Can you move?

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.340
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:49.790
Mom said to have you come downstairs 
'cause she has good news.

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:51.340
Good news?

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:56.130
It's huge!

00:03:56.130 --> 00:04:00.100
This is where the home of the person 
who founded this village once was...

00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:02.200
or at least, that's what the stories say.

00:04:02.200 --> 00:04:04.390
What?! And you're giving that to me?

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.050
Yep! There's no need to be modest.

00:04:07.050 --> 00:04:12.230
All the villagers unanimously 
agreed to give this land to you.

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.540
You don't like it?

00:04:13.540 --> 00:04:16.750
No, that's not it at all, Lytt.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:18.250
I love it!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.540
Oh, good!

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:22.430
But I feel bad accepting it for free.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:24.450
Oh, it's fine.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.730
We've got far more land than we need, anyway.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:31.470
That's right. Besides, if you're here...

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.370
We'll have more parties!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:38.590
C-Come on, you just threw a party 
for me last night. I don't need...

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:40.770
What're you talkin' about?

00:04:40.770 --> 00:04:42.860
Last night's was a welcome party.

00:04:42.860 --> 00:04:47.500
Tonight, we'll have a party to celebrate 
that you've decided where to build!

00:04:47.500 --> 00:04:49.530
Whoa, hang on, Marelle!

00:04:49.530 --> 00:04:53.790
In fact, why wait until tonight 
when we can start right now?

00:04:53.790 --> 00:04:55.350
I agree!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:57.150
But it's still daytime...

00:04:57.150 --> 00:04:59.250
Don't worry about that!

00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:00.990
Get moving while the getting's good, I say!

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:01.550
Good?!

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.210
Now that that's settled, 
let's start getting ready!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:05.490
Wha...

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:08.920
Okay, sure! Let's do this!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.730
That's our Cayna!

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:10.420
Cie...

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:13.160
Well, then, we'd better hustle!

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.160
You can attend to the master today.

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:15.970
We need to let everyone 
in the village know, too!

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.970
Remember to stop her before 
she starts drinking.

00:05:15.970 --> 00:05:19.980
Oh, very well. Just leave it all to me.

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.880
Ugh...

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.770
<i>Same old story, eh?</i>

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:25.150
Don't say it.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:26.360
Here.

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:29.170
Thank you, Luka.

00:05:29.170 --> 00:05:30.800
You smell like booze.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:35.620
Luka, there's this thing called 
"grown-up circumstances"...

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.610
Why didn't you stop her?

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:34.980
Shut up!

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:37.660
I can't help it if she drank 
before I could stop her!

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:37.660
<i>Now they're circumstances?</i>

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.320
Stay out of this, Kee.

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:44.450
Hah. All those times you called 
<i>me</i> a numbskull, and now this?

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.650
<i>Your hangovers have now reached a total of—</i>

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.300
Kee! Shut it!

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.450
You smell like booze.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:45.690
Excuse me?!

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:49.340
If that upsets you, just stop 
her before she starts drinking.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:49.340
Seriously, would you guys stop fighting?

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.650
I get it, okay?! You worthless cat!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.330
I swear, I'm never drinking again!

00:05:51.650 --> 00:05:52.230
What was that?!

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:53.330
Shut up!

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:58.220
Okay, let's do this!

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:00.830
How are we going to build a house?

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:02.370
Don't we need a carpenter?

00:06:03.230 --> 00:06:06.260
Luka, would you mind staying 
with Rox and Cie for me?

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:13.700
Lady Luka, let's watch what 
Lady Cayna does from here.

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:15.560
I'm sure she'll surprise us.

00:06:17.560 --> 00:06:21.060
<i>I'll start by using my Craft Skills...</i>

00:06:23.000 --> 00:06:25.650
<i>Me and Luka, Rox and Cie...</i>

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.850
<i>We'll each need our own room, 
plus a living and dining space.</i>

00:06:28.850 --> 00:06:30.070
<i>As for storage...</i>

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:35.950
Kee, display the largest of 
the house templates you have.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:37.420
<i>Understood.</i>

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.590
Looks good.

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:44.010
Okay, I'll use the lumber 
I got from Kartatz...

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.870
And next, I'll summon an earth spirit.

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.950
Turn the foundation into 
stone to make it solid.

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.040
That is the house's foundation.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:04.570
The house will be built on top of that.

00:07:33.570 --> 00:07:35.530
And it's done!

00:07:36.050 --> 00:07:37.550
Come on over, Luka.

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.240
Okay.

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:42.620
Let's go inside and check it out.

00:07:42.620 --> 00:07:43.300
Okay.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.200
Okay, ready? One, two...

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.470
O-One, two...

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.780
I'm coming in.

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:07.460
You mean, "I'm home."

00:08:07.460 --> 00:08:10.340
This is where you're going to 
live from now on, you know.

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.890
I... I'm home.

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.940
Welcome home.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:20.270
Rox and Cie, could you make 
sure the supports are straight,

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.840
and check for any cracks in the floor?

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.370
Certainly.

00:08:25.370 --> 00:08:26.990
You can count on us.

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:30.150
We will check every last nook and cranny.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.030
Luka, I'll show you around the inside.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:33.760
Okay.

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:37.250
This is Rox's room.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:37.890
Huh?

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:40.950
Wait, no... I meant Cie's room.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.440
This one is Rox's room.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.270
This is the kitchen.

00:08:46.580 --> 00:08:49.690
We'll use the cellar for storing food.

00:08:50.980 --> 00:08:53.740
And this is the living and dining space.

00:08:54.820 --> 00:08:58.260
This is my room. And...

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:03.170
Right next door is... your room, Luka.

00:09:04.440 --> 00:09:05.900
My room?

00:09:07.830 --> 00:09:10.950
Luka, if you get lonely in here by yourself,

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:15.360
don't hesitate to come over to 
my room or Cie's room, okay?

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:16.280
Okay.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.220
Good.

00:09:17.220 --> 00:09:18.410
Master.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:20.990
We've completed our checks.

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.310
We found no problems at all.

00:09:23.310 --> 00:09:28.150
As always, Lady Cayna, you've done perfect 
work. So unlike this numbskull here.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.690
You didn't need that last part.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:32.400
Oh, but it's the truth, isn't it?

00:09:33.050 --> 00:09:35.380
Listen, Rox, Cie...

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:41.850
Lady Luka?

00:09:42.570 --> 00:09:43.680
Luka?

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:47.890
Don't fight...

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.170
Luka, you're so dependable!

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:58.740
I'm officially naming you 
our minister of arbitration!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:01.200
A-Arbitration?

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.450
Whenever Rox and Cie start fighting, 
it's your job to stop them, okay?

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.870
It's the perfect job for you!

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.880
O-Okay... Mo—

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:14.310
I'll do that.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:15.300
Great!

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:19.600
Miss Cayna! Luka!

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.900
Coming!

00:10:21.240 --> 00:10:22.520
Let's go, Luka.

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:23.170
Okay.

00:10:26.650 --> 00:10:31.100
I can't believe Lady Luka 
stopped our quarrel.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:33.150
I never would've seen that coming.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.180
It's all your fault, Rox!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:38.700
You're the one who's always 
picking fights with me!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:44.200
We were going to ask if we 
could help with anything...

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.950
But I guess there was no need.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:50.650
Sorry! I appreciate you coming over, though.

00:10:50.650 --> 00:10:53.160
I can't believe you built a house so quickly!

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:55.220
You're amazing, Miss Cayna!

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:56.070
Uh-huh.

00:10:56.070 --> 00:10:58.900
Well, if it's already finished,

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:02.760
what you need isn't help... it's flowers!

00:11:03.000 --> 00:11:03.870
Flowers?

00:11:03.870 --> 00:11:05.000
Flowers?

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.560
It's our custom in this village.

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:18.290
When a new house is built, this 
helps to make it one with the earth.

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.740
Wow, you have a custom like that?

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.990
The flowers are so pretty.

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:25.580
Keep them up until they wilt.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.950
They also carry our wishes for you 
to live long and healthy lives here.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.330
Okay, then.

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:33.000
So, Cayna...

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:33.700
Yes?

00:11:33.700 --> 00:11:35.430
This calls for another party tonight!

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.340
Huh?!

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:39.180
To celebrate the completion of Cayna's house!

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:40.600
What?!

00:11:40.600 --> 00:11:43.020
Will we be able to stop her from drinking?

00:11:43.350 --> 00:11:44.740
Probably not.

00:11:45.310 --> 00:11:48.050
That's the first time 
we've agreed on something.

00:11:48.050 --> 00:11:50.410
Although I genuinely hate to admit it...

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:54.370
I'm finally up, eh? 
Allow me to introduce myself!

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:55.980
My name is—

00:11:56.940 --> 00:12:00.130
The lead will lead the way in the final act!

00:12:00.130 --> 00:12:00.990
Pretty good, huh?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:05.570
So you ended up with yet another hangover?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:08.360
It's no laughing matter.

00:12:08.360 --> 00:12:12.820
This time, I seriously, solemnly swear

00:12:12.820 --> 00:12:18.240
that I am never, ever going to 
drink again, for all eternity.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.550
Um...

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:23.380
There's no need to be shy.

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:28.140
I'm not... being shy.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:32.620
How's the laundry work going, Mimily?

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.170
I'm making quite a fortune, thank you.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:40.940
After all...

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:44.950
You did make a special 
laundry room just for me.

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:51.050
I don't quite understand what the thing 
you call a "shishi-odoshi" is for...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:55.170
But I really can't thank you 
enough for all you've done.

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.630
I'm just glad you like it.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.890
Oh, by the way, Cayna...

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:06.150
You once said you would find 
my homeland for me, and I...

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:10.600
Oh... I haven't found it yet. Sorry.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.980
No, it's not that.

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:18.200
I was thinking that I don't need to 
find the mermaid village anymore.

00:13:19.380 --> 00:13:23.280
Back home, I was just a burden.

00:13:23.650 --> 00:13:27.710
My only relative was my older sister,
 and I very rarely saw her.

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:30.970
Everyone else just gossiped 
about me behind my back.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:39.640
I wandered off, thinking I might as well 
just disappear, and I ended up here.

00:13:39.640 --> 00:13:42.380
I was lonely at first,

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:46.390
but this village has so kindly accepted me,

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:50.390
and I have this laundry job 
that makes everyone happy.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:54.350
So I'm very happy now.

00:13:55.780 --> 00:13:57.850
I see. Okay, then.

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:01.690
I won't look for the mermaid village anymore.

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:05.120
But if you change your mind,
 just let me know.

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:08.860
Okay! If I do, I'll be counting on you!

00:14:10.300 --> 00:14:15.870
But, man, this feels amazing.

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:15.340
<i>There is a song</i>

00:14:15.340 --> 00:14:19.330
<i>That you can only hear</i>

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:18.910
I finally sobered up, 
and I feel so much better.

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.470
<i>On a night with shooting stars</i>

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:30.240
<i>The blue wave guides my fin</i>

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.970
Scrub, scrub...

00:14:31.280 --> 00:14:32.430
That's it!

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:35.900
Lytt and Luka, you've both gotten much better.

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:39.360
Yes, Miss Cayn—I mean, Teacher Cayna!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.940
You'll start reading more 
difficult books soon.

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:43.880
Okay!

00:14:43.880 --> 00:14:44.810
Okay.

00:14:44.810 --> 00:14:47.320
Well, that's enough studying for today.

00:14:47.640 --> 00:14:48.910
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:48.910 --> 00:14:50.780
Luka, let's go play!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.210
I'll teach you how to make a flower crown.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.030
Okay.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:03.170
I never thought I'd move all the way out 
here and end up acting as a teacher.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:05.590
Since you are educated, Lady Cayna,

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:10.460
extending your hand to lowly commoners 
must be the ultimate charity.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:16.810
Just what kind of personality 
did Opus create you with?

00:15:16.810 --> 00:15:19.850
Look, there's no "upper and lower" hierarchy

00:15:19.850 --> 00:15:23.060
between me and the people of this village.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:26.890
Don't say things like that 
to anyone else, understand?

00:15:26.890 --> 00:15:28.490
I do apologize.

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:35.030
That's it. Now twist that 
bit of butterbur around.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.240
L-Like this?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:38.380
Yeah! You're doing great!

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.300
Here you go, Lady Cayna.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.610
Thanks, Cie.

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.260
It's so peaceful.

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:07.400
Lady Cayna...

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:11.250
Might I suggest you relax for a while?

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:15.100
Spending the whole day resting 
and not thinking about anything

00:16:15.100 --> 00:16:17.740
could be a good change of pace.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:21.540
If you're worried about 
the house and Lady Luka,

00:16:21.760 --> 00:16:24.560
you can leave them to me 
and... uh... the stray cat.

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:28.420
You two didn't make up?

00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:33.180
To expect me and that worthless 
cat to get along is just too much.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:36.590
He and I are mortal enemies.

00:16:36.910 --> 00:16:38.890
Mortal enemies? Really?

00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.020
Well, anyway...

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.890
How could I relax any more than this?

00:16:48.270 --> 00:16:50.980
Although that might be nice, too.

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:56.660
I was stuck in a hospital 
from a very young age,

00:16:56.660 --> 00:17:02.270
so the only place where I 
could run around and be active

00:17:02.990 --> 00:17:07.300
was the VRMMO <i>Leadale</i>.

00:17:08.010 --> 00:17:12.420
I died while I was playing... 
though I didn't realize it.

00:17:12.420 --> 00:17:15.720
Miss! It's morning!

00:17:12.870 --> 00:17:15.720
The next thing I knew, 
I was right there in <i>Leadale</i>.

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:21.540
M-M-M-M-M-M...

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:23.850
M-Mum?!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.600
You pervert!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:28.230
I never dated anyone in <i>Leadale</i>, 
much less married anyone,

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:32.360
but I suddenly had two sons 
and a daughter, and...

00:17:30.890 --> 00:17:32.370
I was too late.

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:35.860
I even had grandkids and great-grandkids.

00:17:36.090 --> 00:17:39.780
Then I met Elineh and Arbiter...

00:17:40.130 --> 00:17:44.140
This would've been so much easier 
if the little missy was with us.

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:45.710
You said it.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:51.380
I wonder if Lady Cayna would be 
willing to join our caravan.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.020
Then came Lonti, Mye, Primo, and Agaido...

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.790
I hope this is all right.

00:17:53.790 --> 00:17:55.020
Yeah...

00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:56.510
I found you, Sis!

00:17:57.260 --> 00:18:00.860
I bet you're goin' to see 
High Priest Skargo again, right?

00:18:00.860 --> 00:18:02.560
I'm goin' with you!

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:05.140
Wh-Wh-Wh-What are you talking about?!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:06.930
Th-Th-Th-Th-That's right!

00:18:06.930 --> 00:18:10.500
Why would we ever go to 
see High Priest Skargo?

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.370
I've got proof!

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:16.390
Hey! Let go of me!

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:21.260
Only a child would interfere 
in someone's romance.

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.700
Oh, shut up!

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:26.100
I was just a little curious 
about Lonti—wait, I mean...

00:18:26.100 --> 00:18:30.190
You're a little too young to understand 
how a maiden's heart works.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:34.090
Almana, Exis, and Quolkeh...

00:18:32.340 --> 00:18:34.090
Okay, I'll take care of it.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.750
Mine, too, please.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.630
Sure! Just leave it to me!

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:41.020
That aside, want to get dinner sometime?

00:18:41.020 --> 00:18:43.020
There's that illness of yours again.

00:18:41.580 --> 00:18:45.190
I bet you say that to all the girls! There!

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:47.940
Shining Saber and Cohral...

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:47.600
Hey! Where do you think 
you're putting that stamp?!

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.560
Your face looks better that way.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.560
Sounds pretty noisy in there today.

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:54.270
Yeah, it does. Did some 
incredible quest come up?

00:18:54.510 --> 00:18:58.300
I've met so many people, 
I'm needed by so many people,

00:18:58.300 --> 00:19:01.400
I've been all over the place, 
I've had adventures...

00:19:01.400 --> 00:19:02.750
Yo, yo!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:05.620
Hey, Master!

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:09.170
You didn't forget about me, did you?

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:13.210
How could I forget someone as unique as you?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.630
Well, I should hope not!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:18.420
So much has happened in such a short time.

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:21.430
I even got a new daughter.

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:26.520
I guess maybe this is what 
they call happiness, huh?

00:19:27.790 --> 00:19:32.060
Oh, come to think of it, 
I made a promise to Lytt.

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:36.480
Say, Lytt. Do you want to go flying sometime?

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.240
U-Um...

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.900
U-Um... Here.

00:19:42.900 --> 00:19:45.430
Is that for me?

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.910
It's for you, Cayna...

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.830
Mom!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.700
Thank you, Luka.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:12.480
Well? Does it suit me?

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.540
Yeah!

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.230
It looks lovely on you.

00:20:16.230 --> 00:20:18.320
You look so pretty, Miss Cayna!

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:24.490
Thank you, too, Lytt.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.150
Well, ready to go?

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:28.960
Go?

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:29.980
Go where?

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:38.540
It was nice of Marelle to 
agree to this so easily, huh?

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:39.700
Y-Yeah...

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.090
I'm scared...

00:20:41.090 --> 00:20:45.010
Don't you worry, Luka. Your mom's got you.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:47.030
Come on, open your eyes.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:47.880
But...

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.270
It's all right.

00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:00.080
I didn't know the world was so big.

00:21:00.080 --> 00:21:02.490
This is... the world?

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:06.410
That's right. This is the world you live in.

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.780
It goes on forever.

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:13.130
And you two can go anywhere you want.

00:21:13.130 --> 00:21:14.580
Anywhere?

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.380
Anywhere you want, as far as you want!

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:19.000
As far as we want...

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:23.560
There are things in this world 
that may make you feel sad or lonely,

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:27.440
but there are even more things 
that are fun and happy.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:29.730
Lots and lots of them!

00:21:29.730 --> 00:21:31.400
Lots of...

00:21:31.880 --> 00:21:32.850
...fun things?

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:35.900
Let's keep looking for them from now on, okay?

00:21:35.900 --> 00:21:36.680
Yeah!

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.940
Good answer!

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.110
Hey, Master!

00:21:48.630 --> 00:21:52.160
Aren't ya gonna give me a ride, too?

00:21:52.390 --> 00:21:56.080
I'm so tired of just sitting around here!

00:21:56.930 --> 00:22:01.500
<i>Yes, there's lots and lots of fun to be had</i>

00:22:01.930 --> 00:22:04.870
<i>here in the land of Leadale!</i>
